+   * Writes the search pipeline the hybrid query is fused by, once.
+   *
+   * The weights are configuration, so the definition is written again after a
+   * change and left alone otherwise: a search that had to check first would
+   * cost a second request.
+   *
+   * @param bool $force
+   *   Writes the definition even where it is the one remembered.
+   *
+   * @return string
